      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The paper presents the results from examination of 67 patients with coronary heart disease verified by coronary angiography. Sixty three patients had a bicycle ergometric tests, 48 underwent 201Tl myocardial scintigraphy along with a dipyridamole test, 19, the scintigraphy in combination with an isoproterenol test. The feasibilities of employing the procedures in the diagnosis of coronary heart disease were compared by statistic analysis."},
